Q: How do I resolve &quot;Failed to collect dependencies&quot; error in Maven? A: <p>We had a similar problem and fixed it by adding a wagon extension:</p>

<pre><code>&lt;build&gt;
    &lt;extensions&gt;
        &lt;extension&gt;
            &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.maven.wagon&lt;/groupId&gt;
            &lt;artifactId&gt;wagon-ssh&lt;/artifactId&gt;
            &lt;version&gt;1.0&lt;/version&gt;
        &lt;/extension&gt;
    &lt;/extensions&gt;
    ....
&lt;/build&gt;
</code></pre>
